html='''<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Western Bluebird blink source study</title><style>body{font:15px system-ui;background:#f5f2e8;color:#26302b;margin:24px;max-width:1150px}canvas{image-rendering:pixelated;border:1px solid #9ca896;margin-right:12px}.warn{color:#893d25}button{padding:8px}</style><h1>Western Bluebird: old awake + native closure study</h1><p>ONE new closed-eye drawing; exact existing awake reused unchanged. Output density1.1; old visible bird width60worldpx. Native1254canvas resized whole to192; no body fitting, bob or pixel repair.</p><button id="replay">Restart labeled blink study</button> <span id="state"></span><br><canvas id="light" width="360" height="230"></canvas><canvas id="dark" width="360" height="230"></canvas><p class="warn">Unapproved study: native tool redrew outside the eye and shifted support/body geometry. Not claimed a completed blink or admitted action. Scheduled closure100ms, awake2000ms+900ms at30Hz.</p><h2>Nearest enlarged eye / feet, light and dark</h2><img style="max-width:1380px" src="ENLARGED"><script>const urls=URLS;const imgs={};let ready=0,start=0;function draw(tick){const pose=tick>=60&&tick<63?'closed':'awake';for(const [id,bg]of[['light','#e4e6d6'],['dark','#25302e']]){let c=document.querySelector('#'+id),x=c.getContext('2d');x.imageSmoothingEnabled=false;x.fillStyle=bg;x.fillRect(0,0,360,230);x.drawImage(imgs[pose],75,30,175,175)}document.querySelector('#state').textContent=`tick${tick}/89 / ${pose} / root stationary`;window.reviewState={tick,pose,root:[0,0],canvasDensity:1.1};}function loop(now){const elapsed=Math.max(0,now-start);const tick=Math.max(0,Math.min(89,Math.floor(elapsed*30/1000)%90));draw(tick);requestAnimationFrame(loop)}for(const [n,u]of Object.entries(urls)){imgs[n]=new Image;imgs[n].onload=()=>{if(++ready===2){start=performance.now();draw(0);requestAnimationFrame(loop)}};imgs[n].src=u}document.querySelector('#replay').onclick=()=>{start=performance.now();draw(0)};</script>'''
